==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|inimitabilis|lang=la}}, corresponding to {{prefix|in|imitable}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈɪmɪtəbl̩/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|?}}

# Beyond [[imitation]], [[surpassing]] all others, [[matchless]].

====Usage notes====
Not to be confused with {{term|inimicable||[[inimical]], harmful, hostile|lang=en}}.

